{"OptimizedCursorPaginator's `get_item_key` assumes numeric values. When used with `order_by=\"-datetime\"` (audit logs), `value` is a `datetime` and `math.floor(value)` will raise `TypeError` when optimized pagination is enabled.": 0.9776351451873779, "Potential AttributeError: `organization_context.member` can be `None` (e.g., superuser not a member). Accessing `.has_global_access` will crash and return 500 for admin requests.": 0.7185928821563721, "`ZUNIONSTORE` defaults to `AGGREGATE SUM`. If the same span payload exists in both `set_key` and `span_key`, its score becomes the sum of timestamps, corrupting ordering and causing wrong spans to be trimmed by `ZPOPMIN`.": 0.8968820571899414, "Rolling deploy risk: switching `span-buf:s:*` from sets to sorted sets (`ZADD`) causes `WRONGTYPE` errors during deployment when older workers use `SADD`/`SSCAN` while new workers use `ZADD`/`ZSCAN` and Lua script uses `Z*` commands on mixed key types.": 0.9524403810501099, "Rolling deploy risk in Lua script: assuming `span-buf:s:*` keys are sorted sets when existing keys are Redis sets causes `zcard`/`zunionstore` to raise `WRONGTYPE` until those keys expire, causing ingestion failures.": 0.9670918583869934}